    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BROE auctioneers are delighted to present this spacious 2-bedroom own door duplex apartment to the market in the exclusive development of Cedarbrook Walk. Number 85 Cedarbrook is a well-proportioned property measuring an impressive 70sq.m. The accommodation briefly comprises of an entrance hall, a bright & spacious open plan living/dining room and stylish kitchen opening onto a stunning low maintenance South Facing Balcony. On the first floor there is a main bathroom to include a W.C and W.H.B. Upstairs there are two bright and spacious sized bedrooms, main bathroom and plenty of ample storage. Cedarbrook Walk has always been a sought after location for first time buyers or an investor as the property achieved an excellent yield. The complex is maintained to a very high standard and benefits from designated parking, manicured green areas within close proximity to all local amenities. The development benefits from an excellent location beside Park West train station where there is a frequent train service to the city centre. In addition, the city centre is accessed by a number of bus routes which serve the complex. The M50 is close by and Liffey Valley shopping centre is a short drive away. Early viewing is highly recommended as this property is sure to create a lot of interest! \r\n\r\nContact Shauna of BROE auctioneers to arrange a viewing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\t\t         4.87m x 1.99m \tCarpet flooring and alarm panel.  \r\n\r\n\r\nGuest WC\t\t\t1.10m x 1.84m \tWC, WHB, Tiled flooring. \r\n\r\n\t\r\nLounge \t\t\t       3.59m x 3.53m \tBright lounge area to included wood flooring, T.V point and door to South Facing Balcony. \r\n\r\nKitchen\t\t\t       2.72m x 3.65m\t        Range of floor and eye level units to include all appliances and Laminate wood flooring. \r\n\r\n(1) Bedroom\t\t      3.15m x 3.17m\t       Stunning master bedroom with floor to ceiling windows looking onto a manicured green. Bedroom to included built in wardrobes and wood flooring.\r\n\r\n\r\n(2) Bedroom\t\t\t3.10m x 3.33m \tWith built in wardrobes, solid wood flooring.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\t\t2.18m x 2.19m \tW.C. WHB & bath and shower unit and tiled flooring.\r\n\r\n\r\nBalcony\t\t\t\t\t\t                Large South Facing low maintenance balcony that overlooks the complex. \r\n\r\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\r\n\r\nPlease note any information, statement, description, quantity or measurement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuations or hand out issued by or on behalf of BROE auctioneers are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any mistake, omission, inaccuracy or mis description given orally or contained in any sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuation or hand out issues by BROE auctioneers. Agents shall not give rise to any right of action, claim, entitlement or compensation against BROE auctioneers. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by carrying out their own independent due diligence, inspections or otherwise as to the correctness of any and all the information, statements, descriptions, quantity or measurements contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuation or hand out issued by BROE auctioneers. The services, systems and appliances shown have not been tested and no warranty is made or given by BROE auctioneers as to their operability or efficiency."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tYear of Construction c.2004.\r\n•\tBER D1. \r\n•\t70 sqm. \r\n•\t2 bed / 2 bath. \r\n•       Management Fee's €1398.48 per annum.\r\n•\tOwn Door Access. \r\n•\tCul de sac location. \r\n•\tDesignated parking space. \r\n•\tDouble Glazed Windows. \r\n•\tFully fitted kitchen. \r\n•\tExtra-large South Facing Balcony. \r\n•\tIdeal for first time buyers and investors."
      },
